  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.5: Fixed BuildKey method usage consistency in RedisCacheProvider. KeyExpireAsync, SortedSetAddAsync, and SortedSetLengthAsync now properly use BuildKey() for consistent key processing with prefix application and validation. ScanKeysAsync maintains direct pattern control for flexible Redis scanning operations. Enhanced Redis cluster support documentation with comprehensive configuration examples, best practices, and troubleshooting guides.",
